# Coop Prep — environment variables
#
# ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ THERE IS NO API KEY IN THIS FILE, AND THERE MUST NEVER BE ONE.           │
# │                                                                          │
# │ The app does not read API keys from the environment, on purpose. Your    │
# │ key is entered in Settings → AI endpoints and stored by the desktop app  │
# │ with owner-only permissions, where the page you look at cannot reach it. │
# │ A key in a .env is a key in your shell's environment, in every child     │
# │ process, and one `git add -A` away from being public.                    │
# │                                                                          │
# │ Copy this to `.env.local` if you want to change any of the paths below.  │
# │ `.env*` is gitignored — but do not put a secret here regardless.         │
# └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
#
# All of these are OPTIONAL. The app picks sensible per-OS defaults for each.

# --- Where things are stored -------------------------------------------------

# Directory holding endpoints.json (your configured AI endpoints).
# Default: the app's own data directory.
# COOP_ENDPOINTS_DIR=

# Where the local speech models are cached (~165 MB total).
# Point these at a bigger disk, or a shared folder, if you like.
# COOP_TTS_CACHE_DIR=
# COOP_STT_CACHE_DIR=

# --- Which speech models to use ----------------------------------------------

# Override the speech-to-text model. Any Transformers.js-compatible Whisper
# checkpoint works. Default: onnx-community/whisper-base.en
# COOP_STT_MODEL=

# Kokoro voice for speech-out. Default: af_heart
# COOP_TTS_VOICE=

# --- Development only --------------------------------------------------------

# Force the Electron shell into development mode (loads the dev server rather
# than the built export). Set automatically by `npm run electron:dev`.
# ELECTRON_DEV=1

# Point the Electron shell at a dev server on a non-default port.
# ELECTRON_DEV_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:3000
